    {
      "id": "claim_571fdf2e7ed8418b801312744f5f6926",
      "statement": "The reserved bucket prefixes are probe/, cells/, nodes/, node-cells/, fleet/, deploy/, deploy-blobs/, wake/, and telemetry/ (some get deleted by celld, so applications must not write under them); canonical objects include cells/<cell>/own.json, nodes/<node>.json, fleet/peer-auth.json, deploy/current.json, and cells/<cell>/ltx/e<epoch>/ where the epoch in the key is the fence.",
