    {
      "id": "claim_116a2f570b304fd59835b25bf6593d8a",
      "statement": "Each node runs a four-write conditional-write probe (create, reject-create, update, reject-stale) at startup and stops on a broken store; celld diagnose repeats the same test — two of the four writes must fail or the store cannot fence cells; CELLD_STORAGE_PROBE=0 disables the startup probe.",
