      "id": "claim_93ec519553ad4f599655628dda21deab",
      "statement": "Azure qualification is documented explicitly: conditional writes and the multipart upload path were tested against a live Azure account on 2026-08-18 under an account key, a VM managed identity, and an AKS workload identity, single-node; celld does not require ranged reads today, so a store ignoring the Range header can still run a fleet.",
